<span style="font-size:13px;color:#4A5568;">Du 4 au 17 déc.</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">$ CA | Exemple d’échéancier</span>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px 14px 8px;">
